WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.417 --> 00:00:03.461
Are you chickening out?

00:00:18.184 --> 00:00:19.811
The rules are simple.

00:00:19.894 --> 00:00:23.064
Victory is determined
when either a human or a god dies.

00:00:49.382 --> 00:00:53.928
It is Niflheimr,
the complete termination of the soul.

00:00:54.637 --> 00:00:57.766
There is no "after this."

00:01:07.567 --> 00:01:10.862
You want to assist mankind, don't you?

00:01:11.696 --> 00:01:13.865
This is a battle of souls.

